sequenceDiagram
actor Researcher as Researcher
participant DatasetAccessPage as Boundary: DatasetAccessPage
participant DatasetExportControl as Control: DatasetExportControl
participant Dataset as Entity: Dataset
Researcher->>+DatasetAccessPage: Select dataset export
DatasetAccessPage->>+DatasetExportControl: Verify permission and format
DatasetExportControl->>+Dataset: Resolve approved dataset path
Dataset-->>-DatasetExportControl: Return approved file list
DatasetExportControl-->>-DatasetAccessPage: Build archive and manifest
DatasetAccessPage-->>-Researcher: Download governed archive
